WEBVTT

00:34.400 --> 00:36.240
<i>In the world of Beyonders,</i>

00:36.320 --> 00:38.960
<i>humans can attain various</i>
<i>Beyonder abilities</i>

00:39.040 --> 00:41.680
<i>by taking the potions</i>

00:41.760 --> 00:45.000
<i>to accomplish the ascension path</i>
<i>to Divinity.</i>

00:46.040 --> 00:48.440
<i>These 22 Pathways</i>

00:48.520 --> 00:50.920
<i>begin with Sequence Nine.</i>

00:51.400 --> 00:53.800
<i>The lower the number of the Sequence,</i>

00:53.880 --> 00:56.360
<i>the stronger the Beyonder abilities are.</i>

00:57.360 --> 00:59.400
<i>The powerful Sequence Beyonders</i>

00:59.480 --> 01:02.960
<i>can have the powers of God.</i>

01:03.640 --> 01:06.680
<i>This evolution is now called</i>

01:07.240 --> 01:09.720
<i>the Path of the Divine.</i>

01:18.880 --> 01:21.360
The Antigonus Family's notebook
is missing.

01:21.880 --> 01:23.480
You're still in danger.

01:25.000 --> 01:25.960
Or...

01:26.560 --> 01:28.080
would you care to join us

01:28.560 --> 01:31.320
and become a Beyonder?

02:06.400 --> 02:09.240
EPISODE TWO, BEYONDER

02:12.680 --> 02:14.040
<i>If you want to join us,</i>

02:14.120 --> 02:15.960
<i>go to Wright at Hound Pub.</i>

02:17.400 --> 02:18.760
<i>If I join the Nighthawks,</i>

02:18.840 --> 02:20.440
<i>my secret might be found out,</i>

02:21.000 --> 02:22.640
<i>but it can be a camouflage.</i>

02:23.200 --> 02:24.600
<i>At the moment,</i>

02:24.680 --> 02:27.040
<i>it's the best way to learn</i>
<i>about the mysticism.</i>

02:27.120 --> 02:28.160
HOUND PUB

02:28.640 --> 02:29.560
This is the place.

02:31.480 --> 02:32.400
Excuse me.

02:35.520 --> 02:37.920
-Kill it! Attack!
-Attack!

02:42.120 --> 02:43.640
<i>What the heck?</i>

02:51.760 --> 02:53.000
What are you looking at?

02:53.080 --> 02:54.840
You have a death wish, rookie?

02:56.600 --> 02:58.840
We don't sell milk, kid.

02:58.920 --> 03:01.440
I'd like to hire a team
of mercenaries, Mr. Wright.

03:01.520 --> 03:03.120
What era do you think this is?

03:03.200 --> 03:05.000
Why would those people exist?

03:09.560 --> 03:11.600
Who told you to come here?

03:11.680 --> 03:13.240
Dunn Smith.

03:18.560 --> 03:19.800
Follow me.

03:44.520 --> 03:45.440
BLACKTHORN SECURITY COMPANY

03:51.280 --> 03:55.160
ROZANNE ADELAIDE, CLERK,
EVERNIGHT GODDESS NIGHTHAWKS

03:57.320 --> 04:01.200
The direct steam train to Constanton,
the Soaring is launched today.

04:03.560 --> 04:04.600
Who are you?

04:05.520 --> 04:07.720
Hello, I'm Klein Moretti.

04:08.600 --> 04:10.240
The captain mentioned a new guy.

04:11.200 --> 04:12.120
Yes.

04:16.200 --> 04:17.080
Please follow me.

04:19.240 --> 04:20.640
LEONARD MITCHELL,
EVERNIGHT GODDESS NIGHTHAWK, MIDNIGHT POET

04:26.480 --> 04:28.320
I'm Rozanne, a clerk.

04:28.400 --> 04:29.920
We're colleagues now.

04:30.760 --> 04:31.760
It's my honor.

04:32.280 --> 04:34.200
We're not always busy.

04:34.280 --> 04:37.240
But in the past two days,
there have been more cases of Beyonders.

04:37.760 --> 04:40.080
ROYALE REIDEEN, EVERNIGHT
GODDESS NIGHTHAWKS, THE SLEEPLESS

04:41.680 --> 04:43.560
That's Royale. Isn't she pretty?

04:45.720 --> 04:47.520
I don't speak with her much.

04:55.040 --> 04:56.240
That's Frye.

04:56.320 --> 04:57.400
He might seem distant,

04:57.480 --> 04:58.680
but he's very nice.

04:58.760 --> 05:00.280
He taught me to sketch.

05:00.360 --> 05:02.120
FRYE, EVERNIGHT GODDESS NIGHTHAWKS,
THE CORPSE COLLECTOR

05:04.240 --> 05:06.880
Kenley's joined the Nighthawks
for about six months.

05:06.960 --> 05:08.640
But he's always nervous on a mission.

05:08.720 --> 05:09.960
KENLEY WHITE, EVERNIGHT
GODDESS NIGHTHAWKS, THE SLEEPLESS

05:14.760 --> 05:16.760
Go on, the captain is right ahead.

05:17.240 --> 05:18.360
Aren't you coming?

05:19.560 --> 05:20.680
Well,

05:20.760 --> 05:22.680
I've always been scared of the captain.

05:23.240 --> 05:24.640
For no reason.

05:24.720 --> 05:26.960
He's actually very kind and caring.

05:27.560 --> 05:29.280
Just like a father.

05:29.360 --> 05:31.440
Isn't it normal to be afraid of fathers?

05:32.240 --> 05:33.120
That's true.

05:50.560 --> 05:51.960
CHANIS GATE

05:54.400 --> 05:57.080
DUTY ROOM

05:58.680 --> 06:01.080
DUNN SMITH,
EVERNIGHT GODDESS NIGHTHAWKS, NIGHTMARE

06:01.160 --> 06:02.080
You've decided?

06:05.160 --> 06:07.760
Special Operations Department,
Awwa County Police,

06:08.240 --> 06:09.400
Seventh Unit.

06:10.560 --> 06:13.320
I thought we were
Blackthorn Security Company.

06:14.160 --> 06:16.000
That's just one of our many covers.

06:16.600 --> 06:18.960
We're under
the Church of the Evernight Goddess,

06:19.520 --> 06:21.680
responsible for tackling
supernatural incidents.

06:22.600 --> 06:23.920
From now on,

06:24.000 --> 06:25.280
you're one of us.

06:26.000 --> 06:26.920
Welcome.

06:28.480 --> 06:30.080
I should call you Captain.

06:31.920 --> 06:32.760
Yes.

06:33.560 --> 06:35.280
But here's a heads-up.

06:36.040 --> 06:37.240
As a Nighthawk,

06:37.720 --> 06:39.360
there's a risk of losing control.

06:40.080 --> 06:41.520
Take that and follow me.

06:43.880 --> 06:44.960
<i>Losing control?</i>

06:58.240 --> 06:59.560
Every name in here

07:00.080 --> 07:01.880
is a sacrificed Nighthawk.

07:03.280 --> 07:05.720
Going haywire is what mostly killed them.

07:07.360 --> 07:09.080
They are the pioneers of Tingen.

07:09.760 --> 07:10.840
We commemorate them

07:11.680 --> 07:12.880
and follow in their steps.

07:22.520 --> 07:24.120
Do you know about the Myth of Creation?

07:25.920 --> 07:27.840
The Creator awake from chaos,

07:27.920 --> 07:29.280
creating the first ray of light.

07:29.760 --> 07:31.320
He then made up all of existence.

07:32.440 --> 07:35.880
One of his eyes becomes the sun
and the other, the Crimson Moon.

07:36.480 --> 07:39.120
His body became the land and the stars.

07:39.920 --> 07:41.800
His hair turned into the phoenix,

07:42.320 --> 07:44.720
his ears turned into the demonic wolves.

07:45.200 --> 07:46.400
We're all from the same origin.

07:46.480 --> 07:49.120
Humans can make potions
with mysticism ingredients

07:49.200 --> 07:50.880
to gain powers to Pathways.

07:50.960 --> 07:51.960
<i>Pathways?</i>

07:52.600 --> 07:54.560
<i>The Hanged Man mentioned it yesterday.</i>

07:55.200 --> 07:57.160
<i>The 22 Pathways.</i>

07:59.000 --> 08:00.520
<i>The Church of Evernight Goddess</i>

08:00.600 --> 08:02.640
<i>has Sequence Nine potions</i>
<i>to four Pathways.</i>

08:03.520 --> 08:05.080
<i>The complete Sleepless Pathway,</i>

08:05.920 --> 08:08.040
<i>the Corpse Collector</i>
<i>is good for self-defense.</i>

08:08.600 --> 08:11.680
<i>The Mystery Pryer and Seer</i>
<i>are advantageous in mysticism.</i>

08:12.240 --> 08:14.080
But it's weak in offense.

08:14.560 --> 08:15.960
What I'm reminding you

08:16.960 --> 08:18.480
is about the Seer Pathway.

08:18.560 --> 08:19.960
We only have Sequence Nine.

08:21.000 --> 08:22.360
Don't decide yet.

08:22.440 --> 08:24.040
See Old Neil in the alchemy room first.

08:24.560 --> 08:26.960
He'll have ways to help you
make the best choice.

08:27.600 --> 08:28.560
Yes, Captain.

08:52.160 --> 08:53.760
<i>We are guardians,</i>

08:54.360 --> 08:56.320
<i>but also a bunch of miserable wretches</i>

08:56.400 --> 08:58.320
<i>that are constantly fighting</i>
<i>against threats and madness.</i>

09:05.120 --> 09:07.480
It seems no matter what potion I choose,

09:07.560 --> 09:09.800
what I need is knowledge on mysticism.

09:10.760 --> 09:13.600
The Sleepless
and the Corpse Collector are out.

09:13.680 --> 09:15.960
As for the Mystery Pryer and the Seer,

09:16.480 --> 09:17.760
which is better?

09:18.360 --> 09:19.960
I'm so torn.

09:20.040 --> 09:21.560
It's like applying to college.

09:23.840 --> 09:24.800
ALCHEMY ROOM

09:30.200 --> 09:31.200
No one's in?

09:38.240 --> 09:39.960
My Goddess!

09:40.040 --> 09:41.400
What's going on?

09:41.480 --> 09:42.560
NEIL, CLERK, EVERNIGHT GODDESS
NIGHTHAWKS, THE MYSTERY PRYER

09:44.360 --> 09:45.320
Hello.

09:45.400 --> 09:46.360
I'm Klein.

09:47.560 --> 09:50.040
I've heard of you, young man.

09:50.120 --> 09:52.040
Dunn told me.

09:52.120 --> 09:55.240
A history graduate from Khoy University?

09:56.200 --> 09:58.160
Call me Old Neil.

09:58.240 --> 10:00.120
No rush in picking Sequence.

10:00.200 --> 10:03.840
Help me tidy up those documents
over there first.

10:03.920 --> 10:05.280
Sure, Mr. Neil.

10:18.800 --> 10:23.280
Dunn said that you're proficient
in ancient Faysec and Hermes.

10:23.360 --> 10:24.760
I'm not that proficient.

10:24.840 --> 10:26.720
I've just spent years studying them.

10:27.240 --> 10:29.880
Start with something easy

10:29.960 --> 10:31.800
or what you're familiar with.

10:31.880 --> 10:33.640
Once you get the hang of it,

10:33.720 --> 10:36.280
you might be able to decipher

10:36.360 --> 10:39.560
these notebooks that went missing
after Emperor Roselle's death.

10:40.120 --> 10:41.640
<i>Emperor Roselle?</i>

10:41.720 --> 10:43.880
The notebooks were almost all lost.

10:44.360 --> 10:46.680
It took me great efforts

10:46.760 --> 10:49.000
to get these three transcripts.

10:49.640 --> 10:54.800
It's said that these strange symbols
he invented contain mysterious powers.

10:55.320 --> 10:57.880
But for over 150 years,

10:57.960 --> 11:01.560
no one could accurately decipher
their true meanings.

11:02.120 --> 11:06.760
However, I've figured out a few symbols.

11:06.840 --> 11:09.800
I'm certain that they represent numbers.

11:09.880 --> 11:11.440
It means,

11:11.520 --> 11:12.760
this is actually

11:13.280 --> 11:15.560
a diary.

11:16.640 --> 11:18.520
<i>Darn it, this is simplified Chinese.</i>

11:19.120 --> 11:20.680
<i>"November 18th.</i>

11:20.760 --> 11:22.560
<i>Truly a fascinating matter.</i>

11:23.280 --> 11:25.520
<i>I've discovered a poor guy trapped</i>

11:26.000 --> 11:28.360
<i>in a storm and lost in darkness."</i>

11:31.440 --> 11:33.040
<i>He is lucky.</i>

11:33.120 --> 11:34.680
<i>He's met me,</i>

11:34.760 --> 11:37.000
<i>the protagonist of this era.</i>

11:37.080 --> 11:39.880
ROSELLE GUSTAV

11:39.960 --> 11:41.960
<i>January 1st, 1184,</i>

11:42.040 --> 11:43.960
<i>it was a magnificent New Year's party.</i>

11:45.160 --> 11:47.920
<i>Lady Florena was truly splendid.</i>

11:49.960 --> 11:51.120
<i>The Emperor...</i>

11:51.200 --> 11:52.800
<i>How were you so passionate?</i>

11:53.600 --> 11:55.240
<i>I've repeated it so many times!</i>

11:55.320 --> 11:58.040
<i>The key to the potions</i>
<i>is not to master but to internalize.</i>

11:58.560 --> 12:00.920
<i>It's not about tapping into powers,</i>
<i>but acting.</i>

12:01.560 --> 12:04.520
<i>"The names of the potions</i>
<i>aren't simply symbolic at its core,</i>

12:04.600 --> 12:07.800
<i>but a concrete imagery</i>
<i>and the 'key' to internalizing!"</i>

12:08.680 --> 12:11.240
<i>There's so much information.</i>
<i>Thank you, my mother tongue.</i>

12:12.160 --> 12:14.360
<i>I might even find out the way</i>
<i>to return home.</i>

12:21.080 --> 12:23.760
<i>I made a hasty choice then.</i>

12:25.040 --> 12:27.160
<i>In hindsight,</i>
<i>I should've chosen the Apprentice,</i>

12:27.240 --> 12:29.360
<i>-the Seer, or the Marauder.</i>
<i>-"The Seer, or the Marauder.</i>

12:30.120 --> 12:32.040
<i>They are the better choices."</i>

12:33.240 --> 12:34.440
<i>What does he mean?</i>

12:35.920 --> 12:36.800
Klein.

12:38.000 --> 12:39.160
Mr. Neil.

12:39.920 --> 12:41.120
What's the matter?

12:42.760 --> 12:43.720
I'm sorry.

12:43.800 --> 12:46.680
I was trying to decipher
and translate this diary.

12:47.320 --> 12:48.600
Decipher?

12:51.880 --> 12:54.120
You sure are young!

12:56.000 --> 12:59.280
Youngsters always think
they are one of a kind.

13:01.400 --> 13:03.280
Any idea about the potions yet?

13:03.360 --> 13:06.160
I can tell you more in detail.

13:07.760 --> 13:09.400
<i>It's best to take good advice.</i>

13:09.480 --> 13:10.680
<i>I'll trust my predecessor.</i>

13:12.320 --> 13:14.600
Mr. Neil, I've decided.

13:16.080 --> 13:17.160
<i>The Seer.</i>

13:21.160 --> 13:22.800
The Seer.

13:23.360 --> 13:24.240
Are you sure?

13:25.240 --> 13:27.320
I must remind you with great delicacy.

13:27.400 --> 13:31.000
Once you take the potion,
you can't go back on it.

13:31.480 --> 13:32.320
I understand.

13:33.040 --> 13:34.400
But I'll follow my heart.

13:39.280 --> 13:41.000
I didn't expect you

13:41.080 --> 13:42.920
to pick the Seer Pathway.

13:43.800 --> 13:46.880
You have quite the personality as I did,

13:46.960 --> 13:48.240
not easily persuaded.

13:48.760 --> 13:49.600
Not bad.

13:50.960 --> 13:52.560
Tidying these documents helped.

13:53.240 --> 13:55.400
I have a yearning
to learn about mysticism.

13:56.520 --> 13:57.600
Yes.

13:57.680 --> 14:01.280
Emperor Roselle once said,
"Knowledge is power."

14:03.080 --> 14:04.760
Since you've decided,

14:04.840 --> 14:06.320
let's begin.

14:11.280 --> 14:13.800
<i>100 ml of pure water.</i>

14:13.880 --> 14:16.760
<i>Thirteen drops of Nightshades extract.</i>

14:17.240 --> 14:20.160
<i>Seven Gold Mint leaves.</i>

14:20.240 --> 14:22.640
<i>Three drops of Poison Hemlock extract.</i>

14:22.720 --> 14:26.120
<i>Nine grams of Dragon Blood Grass Powder.</i>

14:26.200 --> 14:31.000
<i>And the key ingredients,</i>
<i>10 ml of Lavos Squid's Crystallized Blood.</i>

14:31.640 --> 14:32.920
<i>Lastly,</i>

14:33.000 --> 14:35.880
<i>fifty grams of Stellar Aqua Crystal.</i>

14:41.520 --> 14:42.680
Done.

14:43.440 --> 14:45.880
Your Seer Pathway potion.

14:49.160 --> 14:50.800
<i>Is this really edible?</i>

14:51.320 --> 14:53.560
<i>Will I really not get poisoned?</i>

14:55.920 --> 14:57.880
Do I just drink it?

14:59.080 --> 14:59.920
Why?

15:00.560 --> 15:03.440
How about a glass of wine first?

15:04.080 --> 15:05.880
And a dance with me?

15:06.680 --> 15:09.320
Mr. Neil, that's not what I meant.

15:11.280 --> 15:13.520
I know what you meant.

15:14.120 --> 15:16.680
Don't be scared and don't hesitate.

15:16.760 --> 15:19.840
The more you fret,
the worse you'll absorb it.

15:20.320 --> 15:22.120
You have a good reason

15:22.200 --> 15:24.080
to be sitting here now.

15:24.160 --> 15:25.080
Right?

15:40.880 --> 15:45.200
<i>Hornacis...</i>

15:45.280 --> 15:46.360
<i>Flegrea...</i>

15:46.440 --> 15:47.680
<i>Hornacis...</i>

15:47.760 --> 15:48.600
<i>Flegrea...</i>

15:48.680 --> 15:51.200
<i>Hornacis...</i>

15:51.280 --> 15:52.480
<i>Flegrea...</i>

15:53.280 --> 15:54.720
<i>Flegrea...</i>

15:59.960 --> 16:00.800
Klein.

16:01.800 --> 16:03.440
You just took the potion.

16:03.520 --> 16:05.200
Some powers are seeping out.

16:05.280 --> 16:06.720
This is normal.

16:07.440 --> 16:09.760
Now, focus.

16:09.840 --> 16:14.280
<i>Imagine an object</i>
<i>that's very common in this world.</i>

16:20.200 --> 16:21.120
Well done.

16:21.200 --> 16:23.160
Now, adjust your thoughts.

16:23.640 --> 16:25.480
Imagine another object

16:25.560 --> 16:27.200
that doesn't exist

16:27.280 --> 16:28.840
in this world.

16:50.120 --> 16:52.120
Klein, control your Spirituality!

16:52.720 --> 16:54.360
You must do as I say!

16:54.440 --> 16:57.080
Imagine an object
that doesn't exist in this world!

17:02.280 --> 17:03.440
What's going on?

17:04.640 --> 17:05.680
There's nothing.

17:09.800 --> 17:10.800
Stay focused.

17:11.600 --> 17:13.640
Get hold of how you imagined the object.

17:38.480 --> 17:40.920
What's going through your mind?

17:41.000 --> 17:43.720
Get hold of your Spirituality,
not release it!

18:06.600 --> 18:07.720
I did it.

18:07.800 --> 18:09.120
KLEIN MORETTI, EVERNIGHT
GODDESS NIGHTHAWKS, THE SEER

18:09.200 --> 18:11.920
Congratulations, our Seer.

18:12.000 --> 18:13.920
I was right about you.

18:14.000 --> 18:16.360
You're a promising young man.

18:16.440 --> 18:19.080
Well? Don't I look different now?

18:19.600 --> 18:21.120
This is Spirit Vision.

18:21.200 --> 18:23.840
You can now tell my health condition

18:23.920 --> 18:25.640
from reading my aura.

18:26.320 --> 18:27.920
<i>He doesn't look healthy.</i>

18:28.000 --> 18:29.400
<i>Is it because he's old?</i>

18:31.240 --> 18:32.920
There are eyes behind you!

18:33.480 --> 18:34.560
Eyes?

18:35.680 --> 18:36.760
Don't worry about them.

18:36.840 --> 18:39.800
It's just a magical representation
of a ritual.

18:45.840 --> 18:47.000
<i>That was...</i>

18:50.040 --> 18:53.440
The overuse of Spirit Vision
will exhaust your Spirituality.

18:53.520 --> 18:55.000
You'll even see illusions.

18:55.560 --> 18:57.040
<i>Have you met Leonard?</i>

18:57.120 --> 19:01.200
<i>When that chap first became</i>
<i>a Beyonder after taking the potion,</i>

19:01.280 --> 19:02.720
<i>he slipped and fell down</i>

19:02.800 --> 19:04.480
a flight of stairs.

19:05.400 --> 19:08.480
So put a lid on it.

19:08.560 --> 19:11.000
If you can't control Spirit Vision well,

19:11.080 --> 19:12.640
just do as I did.

19:12.720 --> 19:14.520
Tap between your brows twice

19:14.600 --> 19:16.560
to turn your Spirit Vision on and off.

19:17.080 --> 19:18.080
<i>Between my brows?</i>

19:25.560 --> 19:26.800
Apart from Spirit Vision,

19:26.880 --> 19:29.440
you can use Spirituality
on Divination Arts,

19:29.520 --> 19:32.680
like Dowsing Rod
and all sorts of ritualistic magic.

19:33.400 --> 19:35.800
However, let's call it a day.

19:35.880 --> 19:37.480
Before you go,

19:37.560 --> 19:40.160
check the allocated Demon Hunting bullets
and so on.

19:40.240 --> 19:41.920
Here, count them.

19:42.000 --> 19:44.560
Also, don't forget the receipts.

19:44.640 --> 19:46.400
Get Dunn to reimburse them.

19:47.360 --> 19:48.240
Receipts?

19:48.760 --> 19:49.680
Reimburse?

19:50.560 --> 19:52.800
Thanks to the great Emperor Roselle.

19:53.920 --> 19:55.360
<i>Roselle again?</i>

19:59.720 --> 20:01.160
Old Neil said

20:01.240 --> 20:02.320
that you adapted well.

20:02.800 --> 20:04.560
Be it meditation or Spirit Vision.

20:05.280 --> 20:07.360
Maybe just the Seer's special skills.

20:07.440 --> 20:08.880
In the realm of the Beyonders,

20:08.960 --> 20:10.880
special means danger.

20:11.360 --> 20:12.200
At first,

20:12.800 --> 20:14.680
you keep hearing or seeing something.

20:14.760 --> 20:16.680
Curiosity kills the cat.

20:17.400 --> 20:20.240
Don't pry
into what you shouldn't have heard

20:20.320 --> 20:22.000
or seen.

20:22.480 --> 20:23.680
Bear this in mind.

20:25.560 --> 20:27.120
Yes, Captain.

20:28.360 --> 20:30.120
Before you're an official Nighthawk,

20:30.200 --> 20:31.520
you'll stay as a clerk.

20:32.000 --> 20:33.000
Three pounds a week.

20:34.280 --> 20:35.880
This is your cash advance.

20:36.480 --> 20:37.400
Twelve pounds.

20:38.400 --> 20:39.560
<i>Twelve pounds?</i>

20:40.120 --> 20:41.240
<i>Klein's brother, Benson,</i>

20:41.320 --> 20:43.560
<i>only makes five or six pounds a week.</i>

20:44.280 --> 20:47.640
<i>I've overcome poverty</i>
<i>and ranked up to the middle class.</i>

20:50.640 --> 20:51.960
Please come again.

20:55.200 --> 20:56.640
<i>Get a cane first.</i>

20:57.280 --> 21:00.120
<i>Then walk around Welch's house.</i>

21:01.800 --> 21:03.240
<i>This is your daily task.</i>

21:03.880 --> 21:06.160
<i>See if you'll remember</i>
<i>where the notebook is.</i>

21:11.800 --> 21:13.320
Get in.

21:17.160 --> 21:19.400
LORD OF MYSTERIES

21:20.480 --> 21:21.400
Loen Kingdom, Located on the east
of the Northern Continent

21:21.480 --> 21:22.400
Founded by The Augustus Family
in The Fourth Epoch

21:22.480 --> 21:23.400
Main churches, The Evernight Goddess,

21:23.480 --> 21:24.360
The Lord of Storms,
The God of Steam and Machinery.

21:24.440 --> 21:25.320
Brief history of Loen Kingdom

21:35.920 --> 21:36.840
An assignment?

21:38.280 --> 21:39.480
Elliott.

21:39.560 --> 21:41.920
A tobacco merchant, Vickeroy's only son.

21:42.000 --> 21:43.280
He was kidnapped this morning.

21:43.360 --> 21:45.640
Don't we just handle the Beyonders?

21:45.720 --> 21:48.000
We're undercover as a security company.

21:48.080 --> 21:50.840
This client is a previous regular.

21:50.920 --> 21:51.800
We...

21:52.600 --> 21:54.280
found his lost cat once.

21:55.160 --> 21:56.360
Don't worry.

21:56.440 --> 21:58.240
The Seer is best at locating people.

21:59.120 --> 22:00.360
This is his clothes.

22:00.440 --> 22:03.160
Get to work, our new Seer.

22:10.320 --> 22:11.760
The Dowsing Rod.

22:25.800 --> 22:27.400
Elliott's location is...

22:41.520 --> 22:43.080
Elliott's location is...

22:58.960 --> 22:59.800
Go straight.

23:01.320 --> 23:02.200
Go straight.

23:09.480 --> 23:10.320
Turn left.

23:13.720 --> 23:14.600
Turn right.

23:37.480 --> 23:38.640
This is the place.

23:38.720 --> 23:40.600
FORESTON STREET

23:55.360 --> 23:56.360
He's in there.

24:03.360 --> 24:04.400
Two kidnappers.

24:05.320 --> 24:06.360
And a hostage.

24:07.240 --> 24:08.160
Good job.

24:08.240 --> 24:09.800
We'll wrap up in a minute.

24:13.000 --> 24:13.960
<i>Am I</i>

24:14.480 --> 24:16.000
<i>overusing my Spirituality?</i>

24:17.400 --> 24:20.400
Three, four, five, six, seven. Straight.

24:20.480 --> 24:21.400
Bomb.

24:21.480 --> 24:24.320
Three, four, five, six, seven. Straight.

24:24.400 --> 24:25.600
Bomb.

24:44.480 --> 24:45.800
Some kidnapper you are.

24:45.880 --> 24:47.560
Can't you be more civilized?

25:29.920 --> 25:31.320
All bells and whistles.

25:31.400 --> 25:32.400
Let's clock out.

25:33.400 --> 25:34.920
Don't be scared. It's okay.

25:36.000 --> 25:37.480
Who are those men?

25:37.560 --> 25:39.240
Regulars at Hound Pub.

25:39.320 --> 25:40.440
A bunch of gamblers.

25:54.160 --> 25:56.240
This isn't just any kidnapping.

26:00.160 --> 26:01.240
Finally,

26:01.800 --> 26:03.360
this is getting interesting.

26:39.840 --> 26:40.800
Trying to run?

26:46.160 --> 26:47.240
It's gone.

26:48.400 --> 26:50.360
Seer, don't let it get away.

27:32.880 --> 27:34.200
Still trying to run?

27:35.040 --> 27:36.120
A first-time shooter?

27:36.880 --> 27:38.120
That...

28:03.800 --> 28:05.840
<i>The threat of fear</i>

28:06.960 --> 28:08.840
<i>Crimson hope</i>

28:09.960 --> 28:12.200
<i>At least, one thing is true</i>

28:13.800 --> 28:15.400
<i>This life is fleeting</i>

28:16.440 --> 28:18.600
<i>One thing is for real</i>

28:19.280 --> 28:21.200
<i>The rest are all lies</i>

28:22.480 --> 28:24.800
<i>Once flowers bloom once</i>

28:25.440 --> 28:27.360
<i>They shall depart this life</i>

28:37.040 --> 28:39.760
Midnight Poet's ability
will put it into deep sleep.

28:39.840 --> 28:41.800
It's all right. Someone will handle it.

28:42.320 --> 28:43.880
Including memories of Beyonders.

28:44.640 --> 28:47.760
<i>Hornacis...</i>

28:47.840 --> 28:50.160
<i>Flegrea...</i>

28:50.640 --> 28:51.520
What's wrong?

28:52.080 --> 28:53.400
Any new discoveries?

28:54.440 --> 28:55.440
No.

29:02.320 --> 29:03.320
<i>This place...</i>

29:03.960 --> 29:06.120
<i>Klein had been here before.</i>

29:16.160 --> 29:17.440
Good marksmanship.

29:19.640 --> 29:21.640
<i>But I was aiming for the head.</i>

29:22.880 --> 29:23.960
Stay still.

29:24.040 --> 29:25.440
Don't get contaminated.

29:26.960 --> 29:29.840
I wonder where Bacchus got
the potion from.

29:30.360 --> 29:32.080
Wild Beyonders like him

29:32.160 --> 29:34.160
go haywire without a doubt.

29:36.280 --> 29:38.880
I hate dealing
with uncontrollable Beyonders.

29:38.960 --> 29:39.880
Why?

29:40.680 --> 29:42.680
Frankly speaking, you're lucky.

29:43.360 --> 29:44.960
First-timers rarely run

29:45.040 --> 29:46.680
into uncontrollable Beyonders.

29:47.400 --> 29:48.760
You sure define lucky

29:48.840 --> 29:50.360
in a unique way.

29:50.440 --> 29:51.360
Anyway,

29:52.360 --> 29:53.440
great working with you.

29:54.640 --> 29:56.120
<i>Are we that close?</i>

29:57.840 --> 29:59.320
What? Anything else?

29:59.840 --> 30:01.080
There's something about you

30:01.160 --> 30:02.840
that draws me to you.

30:05.000 --> 30:06.080
Likewise.

30:07.640 --> 30:09.000
Oddball.

30:11.280 --> 30:12.520
What have you observed?

30:15.640 --> 30:16.560
I knew it.

30:17.320 --> 30:18.920
He's not special.

30:29.600 --> 30:32.120
If Melissa knows
that I've found a job so quickly,

30:32.200 --> 30:33.360
she'll be thrilled.

30:38.880 --> 30:41.560
<i>This was the building just now.</i>

30:46.480 --> 30:47.520
<i>What's going on?</i>

30:48.160 --> 30:49.520
<i>I already got home.</i>

31:18.600 --> 31:19.480
EVERYONE WILL DIE, INCLUDING ME

31:28.520 --> 31:30.280
THE FOOL

31:36.960 --> 31:38.840
<i>The house across the kidnapping place</i>

31:38.920 --> 31:41.560
<i>has a clue</i>
<i>to the Antigonus Family's notebook.</i>

33:53.560 --> 33:55.520
"Number two, Daffodil Street."

33:57.480 --> 33:58.560
This must be it.

34:03.280 --> 34:08.120
MORETTI

34:13.200 --> 34:14.320
BENSON MORETTI, KLEIN’S OLDER BROTHER,
CLERK AT EXPORT-IMPORT COMPANY

34:14.400 --> 34:15.240
-Benson.
-Benson.

34:16.080 --> 34:17.360
-Welcome home.
-Welcome home.

34:23.120 --> 34:25.000
So are we really going to live here?

34:27.800 --> 34:29.400
Have no doubt, Benson.

34:29.480 --> 34:31.000
From now on,

34:31.520 --> 34:32.760
this is our home.

34:33.440 --> 34:35.520
But the lease
at Iron Cross Street isn't up yet,

34:36.000 --> 34:38.480
so the stingy landlord
won't return our deposit.

34:40.080 --> 34:42.120
Don't worry, I'll talk to him.

34:42.760 --> 34:45.440
After all, he's not even
as smart as a baboon.

34:52.840 --> 34:54.080
This smells great.

34:54.160 --> 34:56.520
Klein, is this really
your first try at cooking?

34:57.360 --> 34:58.480
Of course.

34:58.560 --> 35:00.080
Come on, taste them.

35:03.120 --> 35:04.280
Have more if you like it.

35:04.760 --> 35:05.800
Klein.

35:07.240 --> 35:08.360
This is...

35:13.560 --> 35:16.000
You've got a job,
so you should dress smart.

35:17.200 --> 35:18.320
This must cost a lot.

35:19.560 --> 35:21.320
Benson's been saving up for this.

35:22.680 --> 35:24.000
Try it on. See if you like it.

35:28.080 --> 35:28.960
It suits you!

35:36.040 --> 35:37.040
You look great!

35:37.840 --> 35:38.920
I love it.

35:39.000 --> 35:41.760
Thank you, Benson and Melissa.

35:49.200 --> 35:51.080
We're family. Don't mention it.

35:55.120 --> 35:57.960
Come on! Let's drink to Klein's nice job.

35:58.040 --> 35:59.520
And to our new home!

36:00.680 --> 36:03.080
May our future be even better.

36:03.760 --> 36:05.200
<i>-Glory to the Goddess!</i>
<i>-Glory to the Goddess!</i>
